<title>UK: EU rejects all bids for maize into Spain.</title>
<headline>EU rejects all bids for maize into Spain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's EU grains management committee rejected all bids for reduced levy imports of maize into Spain, member state officials said.</p>
<p>A tender for preferential imports of 500,000 tonnes of maize into Spain from non-EU countries opened on Thursday and will close on June 26.</p>
<p>The import licences will remain valid for 50 days from date of issue.</p>
<p>The quota, approved under GATT world trade rules, compensates exporters for trade losses after Spain joined the EU in 1986.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
